{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "flora_planting",
  "spec": ["flora 6.4.2", "flora 6.5", "flora 6.11", "flora 8"],
  "description": "Derived by hand from flora 6.5 and 6.11 (tests 16 and 17 of 16). Land type L 0x1000, water type W 0x2000, sea 250, sim date 777. Test 16: AddNewFloraOccupant(L, {500, 0, 500}) on a lot with ground 240: the merge pass rewrites pos to (500, -1, 500), the location passes (on a lot), then create, SetType, orientation = RandomSint32RangeUniform(0, 4) (scripted 3), y := lot-savvy altitude 240 raised to the sea level 250, SetStaticFloraData, SetPosition, birth and last seeding date := 777, Init, InsertOccupant; the result is the inserted occupant and pos ends as (500, 250, 500). Ground 260 off-lot -> y 260 (orientation 1). force = true skips merging and the location test and keeps a positive y (300 at x = 1). A water type whose ground is -5 is not raised: y < 0 -> the new occupant is released and null returned after its orientation draw. An unregistered type returns null at once. Without an occupant manager the insert fails -> null, the occupant released. Test 17: A 0x3000 (next B 0x4000, cluster radius 10, cluster height 5) planted at (100, 100) with an A tree centred at (105, 100) (box 104..106, y 260..263): the merge query box is (90, 255, 90)..(110, 265, 110), strict (6.4.2, FQ6), so a cluster height of 0 (a box flat at the ground) would not return a tree standing on the ground; AdvanceClusterType(A, A) = next(A) = B; c = min + max = (210, 200); the candidate (200 + 210)/4 = 102.5, (200 + 200)/4 = 100 passes for B excluding the tree, so the tree is removed, S = (410, 400), n = 2, pos = (102.5, -1, 100); the second round finds nothing (n = 1) and one B occupant is planted at (102.5, 260, 100).",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "flora_types", "types": [{"type": "0x1000", "table": 0.6}, {"type": "0x2000", "table": 0.6, "water": true},
      {"type": "0x3000", "table": 0.6, "next": "0x4000", "cluster_radius": 10, "cluster_height": 5}, {"type": "0x4000", "table": 0.6}]},
    {"op": "flora_env", "date": 777, "lots": [[490, 0, 510, 1024]], "grounds": [[490, 0, 510, 1024, 240], [800, 0, 820, 1024, -5]]},
    {"op": "flora_create", "rng": {"ints": [3, 1, 2]}},
    {"op": "flora_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_clear_events"},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "add_new", "args": ["0x1000", [500, 0, 500], false], "expect": {"occupant": 1000, "pos": [500, 250, 500]}},
    {"op": "flora_expect_events", "events": [
      {"event": "create", "occupant": 1000},
      {"event": "set_type", "occupant": 1000, "value": "0x1000"},
      {"event": "rng", "method": "range_i32", "lo": 0, "hi": 4, "value": 3},
      {"event": "set_orientation", "occupant": 1000, "value": 3},
      {"event": "set_record", "occupant": 1000, "record": "0x1000"},
      {"event": "set_position", "occupant": 1000, "pos": [500, 250, 500]},
      {"event": "set_birth", "occupant": 1000, "value": 777},
      {"event": "set_last_seed", "occupant": 1000, "value": 777},
      {"event": "init", "occupant": 1000},
      {"event": "insert", "occupant": 1000}]},
    {"op": "flora_expect_occupant", "occupant": 1000, "in_manager": true, "orientation": 3, "birth": 777, "last_seed": 777, "state": 0},
    {"op": "flora_expect_refs", "refs": {"1000": 1}},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "add_new", "args": ["0x1000", [700, 0, 700], false], "expect": {"occupant": 1001, "pos": [700, 260, 700]}},
    {"op": "flora_expect_occupant", "occupant": 1001, "orientation": 1},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "add_new", "args": ["0x1000", [1, 300, 1], true], "expect": {"occupant": 1002, "pos": [1, 300, 1]}},
    {"op": "flora_expect_occupant", "occupant": 1002, "orientation": 2, "pos": [1, 300, 1], "in_manager": true},
    {"op": "flora_clear_events"},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "add_new", "args": ["0x2000", [810, 0, 810], true], "expect": {"occupant": null, "pos": [810, -5, 810]}},
    {"op": "flora_expect_events", "events": [
      {"event": "create", "occupant": 1003},
      {"event": "set_type", "occupant": 1003, "value": "0x2000"},
      {"event": "rng", "method": "range_i32", "value": 0},
      {"event": "set_orientation", "occupant": 1003, "value": 0}]},
    {"op": "flora_expect_refs", "refs": {"1003": 0}},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "add_new", "args": ["0x5555", [600, 0, 600], false], "expect": {"occupant": null, "pos": [600, 0, 600]}},
    {"op": "flora_expect_events", "events": []},
    {"op": "flora_env", "manager": false},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "add_new", "args": ["0x1000", [900, 0, 900], false], "expect": {"occupant": null, "pos": [900, 260, 900]}},
    {"op": "flora_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "insert"}, "count": 0},
    {"op": "flora_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "init", "occupant": 1004}, "count": 1},
    {"op": "flora_expect_refs", "refs": {"1004": 0}},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "add_flora_occupant", "args": [1004], "expect": false},
    {"op": "flora_env", "manager": true},

    {"op": "flora_env", "occupants": [{"id": 50, "type": "flora", "pos": [105, 260, 100], "flora_type": "0x3000"}]},
    {"op": "flora_clear_events"},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "add_new", "args": ["0x3000", [100, 0, 100], false], "expect": {"occupant": 1005, "pos": [102.5, 260, 100]}},
    {"op": "flora_expect_events", "events": [
      {"event": "remove", "occupant": 50},
      {"event": "create", "occupant": 1005},
      {"event": "set_type", "occupant": 1005, "value": "0x4000"},
      {"event": "rng", "method": "range_i32"},
      {"event": "set_orientation", "occupant": 1005},
      {"event": "set_record", "occupant": 1005, "record": "0x4000"},
      {"event": "set_position", "occupant": 1005, "pos": [102.5, 260, 100]},
      {"event": "set_birth", "occupant": 1005},
      {"event": "set_last_seed", "occupant": 1005},
      {"event": "init", "occupant": 1005},
      {"event": "insert", "occupant": 1005}]},
    {"op": "flora_expect_occupant", "occupant": 50, "in_manager": false},
    {"op": "flora_expect_occupant", "occupant": 1005, "in_manager": true, "flora_type": "0x4000"},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "advance_cluster_type", "args": ["0x3000", "0x3000"], "expect": "0x4000"}
  ]
}
